{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_10_level_main_10-06_beg","groupId":"main_10","stageId":"main_10-06","title":"痛觉相连","storyCode":"10-7","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"1be319b2240466df4bdf00fa965a425e4333dbe5da292efbc8df88a7222e1d00","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"地下据点内，推进之王小组就之后的行动路线爆发争吵。阿米娅与博士一同说服了克洛维希娅，罗德岛与自救军达成合作。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"将你所见的这座城市印入脑海。\n每建起一座新的高楼，都必然伴随着无数旧屋的倒塌，而正是这些积攒数百年的尘灰，垒成了今日的伦蒂尼姆。\n当你继承了这片土地，你不会只继承了你能见到的华丽皮毛，你也必须将覆于其下的疮疤全盘接受。\n要在这一排屋舍中建起一座新的房屋，是一件非常困难之事。\n你的眼睛需要洞穿皮肉，见到脊骨，来找到支撑起整座城市的最坚实的地基。\n这将会是你的起点。\n维娜，当你忘却所有需要你继承之物，你才能成为合格的继承人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g6_hideout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推进之王，请再考虑一下我的谏言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们必须离开这里，离开这幽暗无光的地下洞穴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"躲在地下的只有胆小的磐蟹与虫豸。我实在无法忍受在这里躲藏度日，放任我们的敌人在地上肆虐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我真的听够了你的怪腔调。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些站出来反抗萨卡兹的兄弟姐妹，哪个不是有血性的好战士？他们要是贪生怕死，早就老老实实去给萨卡兹卖命了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请不要误会，我没有在怪他们。但是......他们的能力有限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么能力有限？当初你半死不活地逃出伦蒂尼姆，是谁把你救了回来？你那时候怎么不说我们能力有限呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不想跟你吵架。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也没跟你吵架，我就是不想惯着你这臭脾气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一年多以前，你刚撞上我们的时候，我和摩根就跟你说过了，要和我们待在一块，你首先得丢掉那些狗屁贵族做派。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可得说句公道话，达格达挺努力的，她变化很大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在谁见了她，能一眼就认出来她曾经是贵族骑士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，你们教会了我......不少东西。你们都很清楚，我早就把自己当作了格拉斯哥帮的一分子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我们已经回到伦蒂尼姆，我没法忘记，我同时还是一名塔楼骑士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你别以为回了伦蒂尼姆，情况就不一样了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道有多少人在盯着维娜吗？我们从来没有安全过。不，就是因为回来了，才更危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一点我们意见一致。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正是出于对安全性的考虑，我才认为我们更应当离开这些身份不明的武装人士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"达格达，你的意思是，你担心反抗军对维娜不利？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们的人员组成......很混杂。万一有人包藏祸心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你觉得我们该去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"据我所知，仍有一些可靠的人留在城内。他们是我母亲的故友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔楼骑士出事时情况紧急，我没能及时联络他们，但我判断......眼下是不错的时机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你的意思是，要我们去投奔贵族？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为是谁害死了维娜的父亲，把她逼到街头躲藏了这么多年？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为......是谁一路追杀，把我们逼出了伦蒂尼姆，害得贝尔德她们生死未卜？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当年贵族们......或许各有想法，但后来萨卡兹就来了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......你以为我们的敌人只有萨卡兹？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你听好了，骑士小姐，你想让我把维娜送去给那些阴险的贵族老爷，你得先有本事拿走我的命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......汉娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你做什么？你弄出这么大声响，是想让所有人都知道维娜是谁吗？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都给我冷静一下。打架并不总能解决问题，尤其还是在这个节骨眼上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在想清楚你们说的话会带来什么后果之前，先闭上你们的嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们是想让维娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......无妨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......维娜？你......你怎么想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实，达格达的顾虑是有道理的。虽然我们跟着阿米娅和博士一起走到了这里，但我们......我们的目的到底不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们只需要阻止这城里的萨卡兹就好，这一点正是反抗军在做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得，我们的目标是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩根，因陀罗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当初你们认我做首领，为的是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......格拉斯哥帮想在伦蒂尼姆活下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当时我们年纪都太小，又惹了太多事。有很多混混盯着我们，甚至还有几个坏警察经常来找我们麻烦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维娜，你比我们都要厉害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你教会了我，只会挥拳头的人不是好老大。你带领我们赶走了麻烦，还把更多人拉入了伙，让格拉斯哥帮一点点变强。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是因为这个，我才坚信你一定是个好主子，未来你也会是个很好的领袖......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......很好。这样看来，我们都没忘记最初的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们听到那名......反抗军指挥官说的话了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们要救伦蒂尼姆，在这之前，他们要救人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁能说我们的目标不一致？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的锤子是为了这座城市......为了维多利亚而造出来的。假如我的力量能救下哪怕一名维多利亚人，我也没有理由不留在这片战场上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"达格达。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉......我不会再向您提起类似的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。我想说的是，你也没有错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如你有自己的使命想要去完成，你不必非得听我的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是一名出色的骑士，但你的头衔并非由我册封。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并不是你生来就必须效忠的领主。不......你该找到你真正想要效忠之物，而不是被血脉中的誓言约束。你从来都是自由的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......推进之王？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维娜，这是不是太......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"达格达她也不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都别再说了。我的想法，你们都听清楚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"达格达，我会等你做出选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了，推进之王。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g6_hideout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛维希娅指挥官，关于我们的合作提案，您考虑好了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅......我可以叫你阿米娅吧？也请你直接叫我克洛维希娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......当然，克洛维希娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，你和{@nickname}博士已经解释清楚了来意。我没有理解错的话，罗德岛是一家......致力于解决感染者问题的制药企业？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过去你们确实和一些城市乃至国家有过合作......我也知道，大部分萨卡兹都是感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......阿米娅，我还是想再确认一下，你们来伦蒂尼姆，也是出于同样的动机吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是说，罗德岛的业务中也包括解决萨卡兹问题？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......萨卡兹并不是问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛维希娅，我们眼前的萨卡兹与维多利亚人的战争才是问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这场战争中流的血已经足够多了，无论那是维多利亚人的血，还是萨卡兹的血......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如战争进一步扩大，接下来又会发生什么？还有多少人、多少国家会被卷入其中？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不能任由这样的惨剧发生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，你的理想......很高尚。你是感染者，你想为感染者而战，这很好理解......但你和萨卡兹有什么关系？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我的理想继承自一位萨卡兹。她是萨卡兹，可她爱着身为卡特斯的我，也爱着所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而罗德岛......罗德岛正是诞生于她的情感之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛为感染者、为萨卡兹，也为所有受压迫者而战。因为我们清楚，在任何一场争斗中，这些人往往都会被那些严酷的上位者所忽视。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论罗德岛有多少不得不与高高在上的人做的交易，我们的视线都不会从真正需要我们的人身上移开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"严酷的上位者......是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。阿米娅，我能体会到你的感受，也很尊重罗德岛的理念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......我也希望你明白，自救军与罗德岛不同。自救军的战士们出身于不同的阶层，有着各种理念，但我们战斗的目标只有一个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——我们想要夺回伦蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我们无法确认罗德岛会一直站在我们一边，即便你能说服我，我也无法说服我的战士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们会站在一起。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"{@nickname}博士......这算是一种承诺吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你们需要的并非承诺。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你们需要的是罗德岛的行动。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我承认。你们也都看见了，自救军人手有限。我们没有办法再为你们分散力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛绝不会拖自救军的后腿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你误会了，阿米娅。我们之中的很多人担忧的绝不是你们不够强大——甚至可能恰好相反。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们的目标太远大，而你们也看见了，自救军还需要躲藏在城市的夹缝中，在一场一场战斗中争取存活的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倘若你们真正想要的，是一场更宏大的战争，而战场只是恰好在伦蒂尼姆的话——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你觉得仅凭罗德岛，能战胜城内的萨卡兹吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"只有站在同一起跑线上的，才有资格竞逐控制权。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"{@nickname}博士，你如此坦诚，这让我稍有一些意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这是在向我承认，虽然你们暂时无力与萨卡兹军抗衡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但等到时机成熟，罗德岛的目标的确是夺走那位暴虐的摄政王的权柄？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们眼前的目标比你想的更明确。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你大可以当作我们想攻入中央城区。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"支持一支愿意合作的武装力量，不亏。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（在来之前，我们不是这么说的......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米娅，她是军事指挥官。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"政客看到的是筹码。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"商人闻到的是利益。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"而将军需要更多力量。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是我们常用的换取协作的方式......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过......博士说得对。就和任何时候一样，我们渴望结束战争，却也从来不逃避战争。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛维希娅，我们的目标是明确的。罗德岛和自救军一样，会坚持战斗到成功阻止萨卡兹摄政王的那一天。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"罗德岛会为自救军提供应急药品。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"可露希尔已在与你们的工程师合作。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"罗德岛还有其他表现诚意的方式。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"而下一次行动，罗德岛会展示力量。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"克洛维希娅指挥官，你是否满意？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......{@nickname}博士，你和阿米娅是很好的搭档。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来费斯特说的没错。你们就是我们一直在等待的帮手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费斯特先生他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他在我和所有大队长面前为你们做了担保。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那刚才那些问题......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他还年轻，有勇气站出来，却未必做好了担负后果的准备。这些责任由我来承担。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛维希娅......你也很年轻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，但我是大家的指挥官呀。阿米娅，换作是你，你也会这么做吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我知道的，你想再听一次我们的说法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，希望你别介意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我怎么会介意？我和博士都很高兴......我们找到了很好的伙伴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"克洛维希娅是优秀的指挥官。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"自救军很厉害。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"谢谢费斯特。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"{@nickname}博士，我听费斯特描述过你，但你还是......出乎了我的意料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等负责侦察的战士们回来，我们可以一起制订行动计划。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这将是一次救援行动，你们的干员应该很有经验吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很期待与罗德岛的合作。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g14_lightinduarea_railway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战士比尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，我们的人收到了戈尔丁女士传来的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉联络人，我们马上就到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战士比尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......能联络上信使就好了，没有她的话，我们真的很难找到监狱的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，但愿这趟能有些进展。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战士比尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，你和费斯特怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战士比尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我都听到你们吵架了。自从我们组了小队，你们就跟左手和右手似的，配合得特别好。我从没见过你们吵得那么厉害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他和我在意的事情不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战士比尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不说清楚怎么知道不一样？你啊，你早就该跟他说说以前的事了。虽说他平时老一心扑在钻研技术上，但他会听的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是你为什么要跟上来？没想到你除了焊东西之外，还惦记着处理人际关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战士比尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，焊什么不是焊？你们都是好战士，我早把你们当成自家弟弟和妹妹了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......注意左边！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战士比尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......差一点。这街上怎么多了这么多雇佣兵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹急着抓住我们。洛克五号......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......洛克五号看到了联络人，就在面包店前面。走吧，我帮你看着雇佣兵的位置。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g6_hideout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老比尔，帮我把这块部件给哈默哥送去，他在加固运粮车的时候一定能用上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"扳手递我一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有弗兰克的盾牌，我又帮他调整了下表层涂料，这下肯定能防火了。但你记得提醒他，这东西被高温烤久了还是容易裂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......你这涂料用的技术早就被淘汰啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不要试试看雷神工业的最新配方啊？贵是贵了点，但我们工程部搞出了个廉价版本，你们感兴趣的话可以打折哦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i13"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欸欸欸烫！好烫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哇，戴有洞的隔热手套，你真是工程师吗？工程师的手难道不是最值钱的嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"崭新的手套可是奢侈品，哪能说用就用啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再说了，我哪知道你会突然冒出来，你不冒出来，我的手可是很稳的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"眼神也不太好嘛，这明明也是工程师十项必备素质之一啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，这都得怪老比尔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也不知道他去哪了，平时只有他会站我边上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"噢，我来的时候，看到有一队人跟着你那副队长走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那家伙......不是说好了要来帮我忙的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你很担心他们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛走得很急，我还没来得及看一眼洛克五号。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我担心早上那场混战会影响无人机性能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......如果心里装着别的事，做出来的东西质量可不牢靠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们能做的事情就是这些，做好了，他们在上面才能更安全不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈，没想到罗德岛的工程师这么会安慰人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎，说什么呢，我在罗德岛上可是王牌心理顾问，就连凯尔希......我很凶的顶头上司都经常来找我说心里话排解压力哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，赶紧把扳手拿来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快开始干活啦！怎么，你还想让我再多说几个笑话才能打起精神吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"马上就会有更多激烈的战斗，我们工程干员可是砥柱中的砥柱，这么多愁善感可不行啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈哈，好的，干活干活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对了，那个无人机......洛克十七给我看一眼。它缺一个飞行稳定模块，我从被打坏的宝贝上拆了一个下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欸，这可以吗？没有什么专利问题？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘘，小声点，我可是背着Dr.{@nickname}偷偷拆下来的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"知道赚大了还愣着干嘛？扳手递我一下啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战士比尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你说什么？你见到戈尔丁女士了？她怎么说？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战士比尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了，这个消息必须立刻传给指挥官！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战士比尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！有、有敌人！我们暴露了，洛洛，快撤退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"去找队长，我们在尤斯顿路发现了反抗军！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"抓住他们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"这什么东西？嗡嗡嗡的......无人机？我知道了，早上在出入口的人也是你！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛克五号——！怎么回事，攻击偏了......？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道是因为没有校准......刚才也没有看到敌人......呃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"菲林，别以为你还能得手。那群跟着王庭混的士兵会被这种东西暗算，我们可不会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战士比尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，你的无人机是不是坏了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没关系，就算没有无人机，我也还能战斗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"啧......竟然能伤到我。你的源石技艺和你的勇气一样，还算够看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我会和队长说，让你死在这里。你可以不必去那座工厂，这样会更痛快些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战士比尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，你快走吧！这里我来顶住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我们要走一起走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战士比尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你得把戈尔丁女士的消息传回去......！指挥官必须知道......知道......那位信使......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战士比尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这条消息......非常重要！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比尔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战士比尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信......指挥官......也相信你和费斯特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战士比尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听我的，别、别再吵架了。我们都是......一家人。当时你爸爸......你爸爸也是这样挡着萨卡兹，我们才能逃掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战士比尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走啊！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......咳咳咳！好大的烟......这人居然带着榴弹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"伤了我们好几个人，你也别想活！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战士比尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......队长？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把他带回去，和其他反抗军关在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"队长，这人为了炸我们，自己受了重伤，活不了多久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他也不用活太久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我知道了，将军的意思，对吧？那其他人要追吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"追上去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，别抱太大希望。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
